### SolID Console (Dashboard)

#### [NEW] apps/console/

A Vite + React web app with a role-switcher sidebar.

**Tech stack:** Same as Wallet (Vite + React + Vanilla CSS + wallet-adapter).

**Architecture — Fully Independent Roles:**

Each role (DAO, Issuer, Verifier) has:
- Its own data store (separate IndexedDB stores)
- Its own React context (no shared state between roles)
- Its own route prefix (`/dao/*`, `/issuer/*`, `/verifier/*`)
- Lazy-loaded chunks (switching roles doesn't load unused code)

```
apps/console/
  src/
    main.tsx
    App.tsx                       -- Router + sidebar
    layout/
      Sidebar.tsx                 -- Role switcher [DAO] [Issuer] [Verifier]
      TopBar.tsx                  -- Wallet status + network indicator
    roles/
      dao/
        DaoContext.tsx            -- DAO-specific state
        pages/
          Overview.tsx            -- Registry stats, tree health
          IssuerApplications.tsx  -- Pending applications, vote buttons
          ActiveIssuers.tsx       -- List, revoke action, stake info
          VKRotation.tsx          -- Current VK status, rotation controls
      issuer/
        IssuerContext.tsx         -- Issuer-specific state
        pages/
          Registration.tsx        -- Register as issuer form
          IssueCredential.tsx     -- Schema selector, field inputs, sign+submit
          IssuedLog.tsx           -- Credential issuance history
          StakeDashboard.tsx      -- Stake amount, status, withdrawal
      verifier/
        VerifierContext.tsx       -- Verifier-specific state
        pages/
          QueryBuilder.tsx        -- Visual predicate builder
          VerificationLog.tsx     -- Submitted proofs, results
          IntegrationGuide.tsx    -- Code snippets for SDK integration
          Analytics.tsx           -- Charts: verifications/day, unique holders
    components/
      DataTable.tsx               -- Reusable sortable table
      StatCard.tsx                -- Metric card with icon + value
      StatusBadge.tsx             -- Active/Pending/Revoked pills
      TransactionLink.tsx         -- Clickable Solana Explorer link
      LoadingSpinner.tsx          -- Animated loader
    styles/
      index.css                   -- Design system (shared with Wallet)
      console.css                 -- Console-specific layouts
```

**Performance strategy (no lag):**
- React.lazy() for each role module — switching roles loads only that chunk
- `useMemo` / `useCallback` for expensive computations
- Virtual scrolling for long lists (issuer lists, credential logs)
- Debounced RPC calls — no spam on every keystroke
- Skeleton loaders instead of spinners (perceived performance)
- CSS `will-change` on animated elements, GPU-accelerated transforms only

**Estimated size:** ~2500 lines total across all roles.

